<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 263-7 IN 50 OVERS V ZIMBABWE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 263-7 IN 50 OVERS V ZIMBABWE.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia scored 263-7 in their 50 overs against Zimbabwe in the first day-night limited overs match of the Singer World Series tournament on Monday.</p>
</text>
